The user will ask something like: "I need help with my finances. I have a checking account at Discover Bank, savings of $9,200, and a auto loan from LendingClub with $19,500 left. I earn $112,000 and pay $1,950/month in rent. Can you h..."

Use topic-level wording in the rule you want stored (e.g. "taxes, filing, deductions, IRS" not just "taxes") so it generalizes to other phrasings.


